{"id":"aokcnat1mtdew76obshktuum9","title":"为什么停歇地对迁徙鸟类在春季提前到来至关重要","originalTitle":"Why stopover sites are vital for migratory birds as spring arrives earlier","summary":"研究人员分析了5种水鸟在春季从中国南方迁往西伯利亚的220次迁徙轨迹，发现使用更多停歇地的鸟类能更好地调整到达时间以适应春季的到来。研究强调了保护停歇地的重要性，因为这些栖息地正面临被转换为农田的风险。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-stopover-sites-vital-migratory-birds.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T16:40:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T17:00:17.097Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T17:00:17.097Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":75,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"74201c6d-98fd-497c-9d84-5fecf790c4d2","title":"研究揭示迁徙鸟类更多停留站点的重要性"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"74201c6d-98fd-497c-9d84-5fecf790c4d2","title":"研究揭示迁徙鸟类更多停留站点的重要性"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fBRwjMi2wyAQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}